# Copy to .env and fill in. NEVER commit .env.
# The deployer signs from an encrypted Foundry keystore, not from here:
#   cast wallet import notus --interactive      (once per machine; asks the key and a password)
# then every forge script / cast send takes `--account notus`. PRIVATE_KEY is
# only read by rehearse-liteforge.sh when it is set, for a throwaway test key.
# PRIVATE_KEY=
# Optional: fee treasury address (defaults to deployer if unset).
TREASURY=
# Basescan (Etherscan v2 API) key for the verification kits.
ETHERSCAN_API_KEY=
# The Base nodes the migration snapshot reads (rehearse-liteforge.sh, MIGRATION.md),
# comma-separated, no spaces, tried in order. A keyed node first: the public ones
# refuse old eth_getLogs from a server. Every node must serve the whole history
# (not publicnode: it answers old ranges with an empty list, which would leave a
# gap). SRC_CHUNK is the blocks one call may span on the first node (10,000 on
# Alchemy Pay As You Go or Infura's free plan; Alchemy's free plan: 10).
# This file is read by bash (`source`): no spaces around `=`, quote a value
# that has spaces or `#` in it.
# SRC_RPC=https://KEYED-BASE-NODE,https://mainnet.base.org
# SRC_CHUNK=9999
